  "description": "SIJBOF crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C55 H66 Gd4 N12 O27,4(C2 H3 N1),4(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Gd1 (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2 (Gd) has 6 O neighbors; Gd1A (Gd) has 7 O neighbors; Gd2A (Gd) has 6 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 4 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.932-3.956 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 109.07-111.43°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Gd4(CO3)(L)4(acac)2(H2O)4]·2CH3CN. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 4 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
